# Finale of Revelation with X = 9, one below the boundary: Bot1 just draws nine cards. The graveyard is not shuffled in (the
# Black Lotus sacrificed to pay stays there), no land untaps (the Islands stay tapped and no choice is asked), and there is
# no exception to the maximum hand size (CR 402.2): Bot1 holds nine cards at the cleanup step and discards two (CR 514.1),
# which join the Lotus in the graveyard. The spell exiles itself. (Mana paid: Lotus 3, three Moxen, Sol Ring 2, three Islands.)

